OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFive dead and 86 missing as
OL,4,A'heartbreaking' fire breaks out on
OL,5,APhilippines ferry
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe blaze, which erupted at 18:00 local
OL,8,Ftime (10:00 GMT) Wednesday, was still
OL,9,Fburning as of 11:00 on Thursday. The
OL,10,Fstrong currents and poor weather were a
OL,11,Fchallenge to those working to
OL,12,Fextinguish it, the coastguard said.
OL,14,FA first responder told the BBC they had
OL,15,Fnever seen such a disaster in Coron,
OL,16,Fcalling it "really heartbreaking".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
